<div class="bhd-page__keypoints" aria-label="Best Hydrate event principles"><div><strong>Confirmed means confirmed</strong><span>Dates, venue and Best Hydrate's role should be verified before an event is presented as upcoming.</span></div><div><strong>Coverage is not attendance</strong><span>Athlete or news coverage does not automatically mean Best Hydrate staff were physically present at the event.</span></div><div><strong>Partnerships welcome</strong><span>Teams, organizers, gyms, conferences and community groups can propose appropriate event collaborations.</span></div></div>

<section class="bhd-page__feature"><div><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Upcoming events</p><h2>Confirmed public dates will be posted here</h2><p>Best Hydrate is not publishing a speculative event calendar. When a company appearance, sponsored activation, speaking engagement or other participation is confirmed, the listing should include the date, location, Best Hydrate's role and a link to the organizer or event source where available.</p><p>For the most current dated updates between formal event listings, check News & Insights.</p><a class="bhd-page__button" href="/blogs/news">View News & Insights</a></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__split"><div class="bhd-page__split-media"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/33411205/pexels-photo-33411205.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1500" alt="Audience members engaging with a speaker at a professional conference" width="1500" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="bhd-page__split-copy"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Recent event-related coverage</p><h2>Athlete competition stories live in the news archive</h2><p>Best Hydrate's 2026 news archive includes coverage connected to athlete ambassador Dianna Proctor, including the World Athletics Relays in Gaborone, Botswana, a 51.20-second 400 m performance in Guelph, and the Canadian Track and Field Championships.</p><p>Those articles are dated athlete and sponsorship coverage. They are not presented here as proof that Best Hydrate operated an on-site booth, event activation or official organizing role.</p><a class="bhd-page__text-link" href="/pages/dianna-proctor">Meet Dianna Proctor →</a></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__cards-section"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Event collaboration</p><h2>Where a Best Hydrate event partnership may fit</h2><div class="bhd-page__cards bhd-page__cards--4"><article><h3>Sport & performance</h3><p>Competitions, teams, training environments and athlete-facing events where hydration education is relevant.</p></article><article><h3>Health & science</h3><p>Conferences, panels or educational settings where the topic and speaker expertise are appropriately matched.</p></article><article><h3>Retail & community</h3><p>Sampling, education or local activations where there is a clear customer and operational fit.</p></article><article><h3>Access & humanitarian</h3><p>Community or NGO events only where the product, safe-water context and intended use are appropriate.</p></article></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__prose-grid"><article class="bhd-page__prose"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Propose an event</p><h2>Give us enough context to evaluate the fit</h2><p>Include the event name, organizer, date, location, audience, expected attendance, proposed Best Hydrate role, any requested product or financial support, and the deadline for a decision.</p><p>For athlete sponsorship or ambassador inquiries, include the sport, level, competition calendar, audience and the collaboration you are proposing.</p></article><aside class="bhd-page__callout"><span class="bhd-page__callout-label">Status rule</span><h3>Tentative is not public.</h3><p>We only want the public calendar to contain events that visitors can reasonably rely on.</p></aside></section>

<section class="bhd-page__brand-context"><div><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Event inquiry</p><h2>Have an event that fits?</h2><p>Send the event details through the contact page and identify the message as Events or Sponsorship.</p></div><div class="bhd-page__brand-actions"><a class="bhd-page__button" href="/pages/contact">Contact Us</a><a class="bhd-page__button bhd-page__button--secondary" href="/pages/partnerships">Partnerships</a></div></section>

